291
00:21:10,706 --> 00:21:15,256
For the designs, give two that differ in
kind, and for each say what it costs the

292
00:21:15,296 --> 00:21:19,903
contributor or the maintainer, because a
design without a cost hasn't been thought

293
00:21:19,943 --> 00:21:24,380
