295
00:21:27,863 --> 00:21:29,912
Let's land this, in your own words.

296
00:21:30,252 --> 00:21:35,304
ML CI is ordinary until it needs a GPU,
a large model or a paid key, and each

297
00:21:35,344 --> 00:21:38,081
collides with a default of GitHub Actions.

298
00:21:38,421 --> 00:21:43,480
Fork pull requests get no secrets;
pull_request_target plus a checkout of the fork's

299
00:21:43,520 --> 00:21:46,697
code runs untrusted code
with your secrets and token.

300
00:21:47,037 --> 00:21:51,866
Defensible designs: secret-free checks
for everyone and a maintainer-triggered

301
00:21:51,906 --> 00:21:56,174
evaluation; evaluation after merge;
or prompts read strictly as data.

302
00:21:56,514 --> 00:22:01,139
A serving repository records the model
by a pinned reference, the base image by

303
00:22:01,179 --> 00:22:05,746
digest, and the commit in the image;
secrets enter a build only through secret

304
00:22:05,786 --> 00:22:06,159
mounts.

305
00:22:06,499 --> 00:22:11,571
An agent is a contributor whose local hooks
never run, so required checks, a human

306
00:22:11,611 --> 00:22:15,997
